	(text "TPA3220 ACTIVE SPEAKER  -  ESP32 / PCM5122 / TPA3220"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5adc0116-237f-4ca4-99bd-08e498bac796")
	)
	(text "POWER TREE (12-16 V DC in, J1 on POWER sheet)\nVIN -> F1 5 A T -> Q1 reverse-polarity P-FET -> D2 TVS -> PVDD\n  PVDD -> TPA3220 PVDD + VDD (internal 5 V LDO for AVDD/GVDD) ... up to ~3.5 A peak\n  PVDD -> U3 LMR51430XF buck 5.0 V / 500 kHz FPWM .................... ~0.35 A max\n     5V -> U4 TLV1117LV33 -> 3V3-ESP (ESP32, pull-ups) ............ 0.15-0.25 A avg, 0.5 A peak\n     5V -> R1 2R2 -> IC4 TPS7A2033 -> DAC AVDD/DVDD/CPVDD .......... ~40 mA\nSIGNALS\n  ESP32 IO25/26/13 -> PCM5122 LRCK/BCK/DIN (3-wire I2S, no MCLK, PLL from BCK)\n  ESP32 IO21/22 <-> PCM5122 SDA/SCL, address 0x4C; PCM5122 does master volume\n  PCM5122 OUTL -> TPA3220 CH1 -> J16 WOOFER,  OUTR -> CH2 -> J17 TWEETER\n  IO27 -> AMP_RESET_N, IO33 -> DAC_XSMT, IO34 <- AMP_FAULT_N, IO35 <- AMP_OTW_N,\n  IO36 <- VIN_SENSE (PVDD/11)\nPOWER-UP: buck starts at PVDD ~9 V; ESP32 boots with amp held in RESET (4k7) and DAC\nsoft-muted (XSMT 10k pull-down). Firmware: init PCM5122 over I2C, start I2S clocks,\nXSMT high, then RESET high (gain latched; ~20 ms ramp via 33 nF CMUTE)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6dc8b356-d466-486d-b2da-494d9c0e2875")
	)
